              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>PRACTICE AREAS</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">At Lex &amp; Partners, our expertise spans across multiple legal disciplines:<br><br><b>1. Corporate &amp; Commercial Law</b><br><br>We assist companies in drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial agreements, mergers,\n<br>acquisitions, and compliance issues.<br><br>Our goal is to protect your business interests while ensuring long-term growth.<br><br><b>2. Civil &amp; Criminal Litigation</b><br><b>\n<br></b>Our litigation team represents clients in civil disputes, contract breaches, personal injury claims, and\n<br>criminal defense.\n<br>\n<br>We focus on strong case strategy, thorough research, and persuasive argumentation.\n<br><br><b>3. Real Estate &amp; Property Law<br></b>\n<br>From property transactions to tenancy disputes, our firm provides reliable legal support to buyers,\n<br>sellers, and developers.<br>\n<br><b>4. Family &amp; Divorce Law<br></b>\n<br>We handle sensitive family matters with care, confidentiality, and respect — including divorce, child\n<br>custody, and asset division.<br>\n<br><b>5. Employment Law</b><br><b>\n</b><br>We guide both employers and employees through workplace disputes, unfair dismissals, and contractual\n<br>issues.<br>\n<br><b>6. Intellectual Property (IP) Law</b><br><b>\n</b><br>Our IP team protects your creative assets — trademarks, copyrights, and patents — from infringement\n<br>and misuse.<b><br></b><br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZLzqwPncA",
